{"id":"9570c90f-03a0-4b86-8080-d507ed1e069e","object":"chat.completion","created":1784835584,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    if not isinstance(case, dict):\\n        raise ValueError('case must be a dict')\\n    payload = case.get('payload')\\n    if payload is None:\\n        raise ValueError('missing payload')\\n    threshold = payload.get('threshold')\\n    if threshold is None:\\n        raise ValueError('missing threshold')\\n    calls = payload.get('calls')\\n    if not isinstance(calls, list):\\n        raise ValueError('calls must be a list')\\n    diagnostics = []\\n    accepted_ids = []\\n    total_gain = 0.0\\n    total_normalized = 0.0\\n    for call in calls:\\n        if not isinstance(call, dict):\\n            raise ValueError('each call must be a dict')\\n        call_id = call.get('call_id')\\n        if call_id is None:\\n            raise ValueError('missing call_id')\\n        loss_without = call.get('loss_without_call')\\n        loss_with = call.get('loss_with_call')\\n        tokens = call.get('prediction_tokens')\\n        parseable = call.get('parseable')\\n        if None in (loss_without, loss_with, tokens, parseable):\\n            raise ValueError('missing field in call')\\n        if not isinstance(parseable, bool):\\n            raise ValueError('parseable must be bool')\\n        gain = loss_without - loss_with\\n        normalized_gain = gain / tokens\\n        accepted = parseable and normalized_gain >= threshold\\n        diagnostics.append({\\n            'call_id': call_id,\\n            'gain': round(gain, 8),\\n            'normalized_gain': round(normalized_gain, 8),\\n            'accepted': accepted\\n        })\\n        if accepted:\\n            accepted_ids.append(call_id)\\n            total_gain += gain\\n            total_normalized += normalized_gain\\n    return {\\n        'accepted_call_ids': accepted_ids,\\n        'diagnostics': diagnostics,\\n        'total_gain': round(total_gain, 8),\\n        'total_normalized_gain': round(total_normalized, 8),\\n        'accepted_count': len(accepted_ids)\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to output a JSON object with key \"implementation\" containing Python source code for function solve(case). The function should take a case dict with payload containing threshold and calls list. For each call, compute gain = loss_without_call - loss_with_call. Then normalized_gain = gain / prediction_tokens (since \"at least one prediction token\"). Require parseable == True and normalized_gain >= threshold. Return dict with accepted call_ids and per-call diagnostics in supplied order. Diagnostics should include call_id, gain, normalized_gain, accepted (bool). Also need to compute total_gain, total_normalized_gain, accepted_count. Keep stable order. Return JSON-serializable dict.\n\nWe must not mutate case. Use only standard library.\n\nImplementation: define solve(case). Validate case has required fields. Iterate calls, compute. Return dict.\n\nLet's write the code."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1769,"completion_tokens":696,"total_tokens":2465,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1664},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":183},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1664,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":105},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}